\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{white}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.3in}
\centering\vspace{0.15cm}
{\footnotesize\color{StormTeal}\kaiti\selectfont
「那時，耶和華從旋風中回答約伯說：」}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\itshape\color{TextGray}
“Then the LORD answered Job out of the whirlwind and said,”}\\[0.10em]
{\scriptsize\color{ChapterAsh} 約伯記 38:1 \textperiodcentered\ Job 38:1}
\vspace{0.15cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
\cleardoublepage

%% ============================================
%% FRONTISPIECE — "全書一句話" spread built on Job's own resolution
%% verse (42:5-6), the same role Acts 1:8 and Isaiah 12:2-3 play in
%% the sister volumes.
%% ============================================
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterAsh} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
我從前風聞有你，現在親眼\textbf{\color{DawnGold!80!black}看見}你。\\
因此我厭惡自己，在塵土和爐灰中\textbf{\color{DawnGold!80!black}懊悔}。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
I have heard of You by the hearing of the ear;\\
but now my eye \textbf{sees} You;\\
therefore I retract, and I \textbf{repent} in dust and ashes.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterAsh} 約伯記 42:5-6 \textperiodcentered\ Job 42:5-6
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 四十二章 \textperiodcentered\ 七卷 \textperiodcentered\ 一句耶和華從旋風中的回答\\
\textit{Forty-two chapters \textperiodcentered\ seven volumes \textperiodcentered\ one answer from the whirlwind}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{2.8cm}p{2.4cm}p{6.9cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{段落} & \textbf{章節} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
苦難的敘事框架 & 1-2, 42章 & 公義人毫無緣由地受試煉，最終滿被恢復——散文體的序幕與結局，包住全書 \\
三輪人的辯論 & 3-37章 & 約伯與三友三輪對話，繼而以利戶發言——詩體，激辯受苦的意義究竟何在 \\
耶和華親自回答 & 38-42章 & 神從旋風中回答，卻不直接解釋苦難的原因，而是以創造的智慧使約伯俯伏、看見 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterAsh} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一篇苦難的答案手冊，是來看一位公義人如何在無解之處仍然堅持認識神。\\
若你讀完四十二章卻只記得「約伯的忍耐」——請從頭再讀，\\
這次留意：神從未向約伯解釋苦難的原因，卻讓約伯親眼看見了祂自己。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not reading a manual of answers to suffering — you are watching a
righteous man hold on to the knowledge of God where no answer is given.\\
If after forty-two chapters you remember only "the patience of Job," read it again.\\
This time notice: the LORD never explains the reason for the suffering — He lets
Job see Him.}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
